&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:27pt;min-height:27pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:23pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-19pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt;(5) 増加した資本金及び資本準備金に関する事項&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
